        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Dog breeds: Bavarian Hound, Bavarian Mountain Hound, Bloodhound, Wirehaired Dachshund\n- Characters: Oscar the Grouch\n\nFacts:\n- The Bavarian Mountain Hound was produced by crossing the Bavarian Hound with the Wirehaired Dachshund.\n- The Wirehaired Dachshund is descended from bloodhounds.\n- Oscar the Grouch is an example of a Dachshund, which is the other breed of dog referenced in the chunk.",
